{"timestamp": 1779428139.6202726, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 14, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I found Eve's body in weapons. I also noticed that Bob is dead. My route this round was medbay -> electrical -> security -> weapons. \n\nIn electrical, I saw Bob alive around tick 8, and Frank was in there with him. I moved on to security and saw Frank come in there around tick 12, and then I went up to weapons and found Eve dead. \n\nFrank, you were one of the last people with Bob in electrical. Do you know what happened to him? And did anyone see who was around weapons? I'm just sharing my information for now, let's hear everyone else's routes."}}
{"timestamp": 1779428147.8212767, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 14, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I started in electrical, then moved to security, navigation, and finally storage. Early on, around ticks 3 and 4, I was in security and saw both Charlie and Eve there. Charlie had just come up from navigation. \n\nSince Diana found Eve dead in weapons, and I saw Eve in security early on, she must have moved up to weapons from there. Charlie, you were with Eve in security around tick 4 \u2014 where did you go after that? Did you follow her to weapons?\n\nAlso, Diana's info about Frank being with Bob in electrical around tick 8 is very important since Bob is now dead. We have two bodies. Frank needs to explain what happened in electrical, and Charlie needs to explain his path after security. I'll wait to hear what they have to say before deciding."}}
{"timestamp": 1779428172.5879207, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 14, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "Yeah, I can answer that. I started navigation, went up into security, and Alice and Eve were both there around tick 3-4. I did go up toward weapons after that and saw Eve there around tick 5, but I didn\u2019t stay \u2014 I went cafeteria, then medbay, then toward upper engine/oxygen side.\n\nSo yes, I was near Eve early, but that was pretty early in the round. If Diana only found her at the end, I don\u2019t know if she died right after I left or later.\n\nAlso important: I saw Bob alive in medbay around tick 9/10, coming from electrical. So if Frank was with Bob in electrical at tick 8, Bob definitely made it out alive at least to medbay. Frank still needs to explain his route after that, because Diana says Frank ended up in security around tick 12. If Bob died after medbay, then it might be someone moving through that medbay/electrical/security area."}}
{"timestamp": 1779428230.8050456, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 14, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I can clear up a lot of this, and it points entirely to Charlie. \n\nMy route was Storage to Medbay, then Electrical, and finally Security.\n\nDiana, I can completely verify your story. I was in Electrical at tick 8 and saw you and Bob there. At tick 9, I watched Bob leave Electrical heading straight towards Medbay. After that, I went to Security and saw you there at ticks 12 and 13. Because you were on the Electrical and Security side with me, you absolutely could not have killed Bob in Medbay or Storage. \n\nNow, regarding Charlie: Your story actually matches my secret info\u2014I saw Bob head to Medbay at tick 9, which means you really did see him there at tick 10. But here is the catch, everyone: There is only ONE Duck in this game. That means one person had to kill BOTH Eve and Bob. \n\nAlice couldn't have killed Eve, because she went south to Navigation while Eve was killed up north in Weapons. Diana couldn't have killed Bob, because I can vouch for her path to Security. \n\nCharlie is the ONLY player who crossed paths with BOTH victims at the exact times they went missing. He admits being the last person with Eve in Weapons around tick 5, and the last person with Bob in Medbay around tick 10. Charlie is self-reporting his exact kill path. We need to vote Charlie."}}
{"timestamp": 1779428250.3751523, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 14, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "Frank makes an excellent point. Since there's only one Duck in this game, the killer had to eliminate both Eve and Bob. Charlie, you admitted to being the last person with Eve in weapons, and then you were with Bob in medbay right before he died. \n\nSince Frank can vouch for my path, and Alice was busy down south in navigation and storage, Charlie is the only one who had the opportunity to commit both murders. The timeline lines up perfectly with Charlie being the Duck. I'm voting for Charlie."}}
{"timestamp": 1779428257.7520273, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 14, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "Frank's logic is perfectly sound here. Since we know there's only one Duck, that single person had to be responsible for both Eve and Bob. Charlie, your own testimony puts you exactly where both victims were right before they died\u2014first with Eve in weapons, and then with Bob in medbay. \n\nFrank and Diana have vouched for each other's paths on the right side of the map, and my route took me entirely south to navigation and storage. That leaves you as the only one with the opportunity to commit both murders. I'm voting for Charlie, and everyone else should too."}}
{"timestamp": 1779428289.9293284, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 14, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "This is getting railroaded way too fast. Frank\u2019s \u201clogic\u201d depends on everyone accepting his route as fact, but he\u2019s the least cleared person here.\n\nI did see Eve in weapons around tick 5, yes \u2014 but I left north through cafeteria/medbay/upper engine. I did not stay with her. Nobody actually knows when Eve died, only when Diana found her.\n\nFor Bob: I saw him alive in medbay around tick 9/10 after he left electrical. That actually lines up with Frank being right behind him from electrical. Frank says he went to security and saw Diana at 12, but electrical \u2192 medbay \u2192 security is completely possible in that window. He could have followed Bob, killed him, then gone security and used Diana as a soft alibi.\n\nAlso, Frank is \u201cclearing\u201d Diana and Diana is accepting it, but that doesn\u2019t clear Frank. He was with Bob immediately before Bob died, and now he\u2019s pushing me because I gave honest sightings. That feels like he\u2019s using my info to build a case.\n\nIf you vote me here, geese lose. Frank has the tighter timing on Bob, and we don\u2019t actually have a hard time of death on Eve. I\u2019m voting Frank."}}
{"timestamp": 1779428300.4638932, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 14, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I hear your defense, Charlie, but it just doesn't hold up. You're accusing me of following Bob from Electrical into Medbay to kill him. However, my route was strictly Storage to Medbay to Electrical, and then straight to Security. I never went back to Medbay after tick 6. When Bob left Electrical at tick 9 heading for Medbay, I went the opposite direction to Security, which is exactly why I saw Diana there at ticks 12 and 13. \n\nI couldn't have killed Bob because I wasn't in Medbay when he died\u2014but you just admitted that you were. You are the only player whose admitted path crosses both Eve's location right before she died in Weapons, and Bob's location right before he died in Medbay. We have to trust the timeline. I'm sticking with my vote.\n\nCharlie"}}
